sequenceDiagram
  participant U as npm run demo
  participant C as CLI (scan, report, pr)
  participant S as sources + flows
  participant E as engine (deterministic)
  participant L as LLM provider (fake)
  participant O as output
  U->>C: pr --base HEAD~1 --head HEAD --repo <tmp two-commit copy> (deterministic only)
  C-->>U: 2 introduced, 1 removed, exit code 1 for the PR check
  U->>C: scan fixtures/telehealth-clinic --regime both --format json,sarif,md --docs all --report-lang pt-BR
  C->>S: parse 8 files (TS, SQL, Prisma)
  S-->>E: field candidates, value hits, sink reaches
  E->>E: rules, severity matrix, confidence, suppressions
  E->>L: labelAmbiguousField for 2 ambiguous fields (obs, extra)
  L-->>E: labels with evidence substring and confidence
  E->>E: mergeFindings(deterministic, labels): superset guaranteed
  E->>L: draftNarrative(facts) for 8 sections of 4 documents
  L-->>E: prose sections (Zod-validated, numbers and articles from facts)
  E->>O: findings.json, findings.sarif, inventory.md, ropa.md, dpia.md, registro.pt-BR.md, ripd.pt-BR.md
  O-->>U: summary + "drafts, not legal advice" banner, exit code 1 (errors found)
